!$all = {"en":{"source_001":"Source: https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","part_001":"Multi-Head Attention","part_002":"Q K V Projection and RoPE","part_003":"Semantic Generation","act_004":"Raw K matrix = X x W_K","act_005":"Raw Q matrix = X x W_Q","act_006":"Value V = X x W_V","note_003":"          Linear Projection (Matrix Multiplication): X x W_Q, X x W_K, X x W_V (toy values below are assumed).\n          Q (Query) = what a token is looking for. K (Key) = the label it offers.\n          V (Value) = the content it passes on when picked.\n          Q and K decide WHO to listen to; V is WHAT gets taken in.\n          Toy setup (terms used below):\n          |= Term |= Meaning |= Toy (head 1 shown) |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | length of one token's vector | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | parallel attention heads (each with its own W_Q, W_K, W_V; their Z are concatenated back to d_model) | 2 (head 1 worked out; head 2 is drawn, not computed) | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | length of one Q, K or V row, per head | 4 / 2 = 2 (V rows too: d_v = d_k) | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","part_004":"Geometric Rotation","act_007":"Final Q_cat = Raw Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"Final K_cat = Raw K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"Final Q_on = Raw Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"Final K_on = Raw K_on x R_position 1","act_011":"...","note_004":"          Right now, the Raw Q and Raw K matrices only contain semantic information—they\n          have no concept of sequence order yet. This is the exact moment RoPE\n          (Rotary Position Embedding) steps in to finish generating them.\n          RoPE rotates only Q and K (never V).\n          Toy rotation here (d_k = 2, so one dim pair): (0, 1) turns 90° per position.\n          90°: [a, b] -> [-b, a].  180°: [a, b] -> [-a, -b].\n          (Real RoPE rotates every dim pair of the head, each at its own frequency.)\n          The final K and V are appended to the KV cache, so during Decode\n          only the new token's Q, K, V are computed.","part_005":"The Dot Product","act_012":"Raw score cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"Raw score on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"Raw score desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_005":"        Purpose: score how relevant each token's Key is to this token's Query\n        (\"how much should token i look at token j?\"). Dot product q x k: multiply\n        element by element, then add up (sums in the Raw score boxes above).\n        Large = same direction (key matches the query), near 0 = unrelated.\n        The GPU scores all pairs at once, Q x K^T: [3, 2] x [2, 3] = a 3 × 3 grid (row i, column j),\n        each cell = 2 multiply-adds (d_k = 2). Raw scores, not weights yet:\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- Raw score cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- Raw score on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- Raw score desk\n        \"cat\" scores highest with itself. \"on\" aligns most with \"cat\".\n        \"desk\" aligns most with \"on\", and also with \"cat\".\n\n        During Decode only the last row is computed: the new token's query\n        against all cached keys (1 x seq_len scores).","act_015":"Scaling (div sqrt d_k)","note_006":"      To keep the numbers from exploding and blinding the Softmax layer, the entire grid is divided by sqrt d_k.\n      Why: each score is a sum of d_k products, so it grows with d_k; dividing by sqrt d_k keeps the scale steady.\n      Here d_k = 2 (the length of one Q or K row; see the table in the Linear Projection note), so sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41.\n      The GPU divides every single cell in our matrix by 1.41\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"Causal Mask (The Filter Rule)","note_007":"      This is the exact sub-step where the Causal Mask strikes.\n      The system compares the Position ID of the Query (the row)\n      against the Position ID of the Key (the column).\n      The Rule: If Key Position > Query Position,\n      it is a future token. Replace the score with negative infinity (-∞).\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"The Softmax Magnification (The Percentage Generation)","note_008":"      When this masked grid is fed into Softmax,\n      the math handles the rows beautifully: Row 0 (\"cat\"): Because e^-∞ = 0,\n      the future slots get an absolute 0% weight. \"cat\" is forced to look at itself 100%.\n      Row 1 (\"on\"): The future slot for \"desk\" gets 0%. The remaining scores (2.12 and 0.71) compete,\n      resulting in about 80% cat and 20% on (e^2.12 = 8.33, e^0.71 = 2.03, 8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80).\n      Row 2 (\"desk\"): No values were blocked.\n      The scaled scores (1.41, 2.83, -1.41) compete openly, resulting in about\n      19% cat, 80% on, and 1% desk (e^1.41 = 4.10, e^2.83 = 16.95, e^-1.41 = 0.24, over their sum 21.29).","act_018":"Attention Map Matrix","note_009":"      [100% (1.0), 0% (0.0), 0% (0.0)]\n      [80% (0.8), 20% (0.2), 0% (0.0)]\n      [19% (0.19), 80% (0.8), 1% (0.01)]","act_019":"Value Matrix Multiplication (The Mixing)","note_010":"      In this step, the model takes the Attention Map Matrix and multiplies it by the Value Matrix (V).\n      This is where tokens actually exchange information: each token's output Z is a weighted sum of the Value vectors of the tokens it attends to (e.g. \"on\" = 80% of cat's V + 20% of its own).\n\n      Context Matrix (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      To see this mathematically, let’s work out head 1 and assume each word's Value vector has d_head = 2 numbers, the same length as Q and K (in real models like Llama 3, d_head is typically 128 numbers per head).\n      Let's assign some realistic semantic numbers to our Value vectors:\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      The GPU multiplies the weights from each row of the Attention Map against the Value columns.\n      This is a standard weighted sum performed for each row simultaneously in parallel:","note_011":"        z_cat = (1.0 x [2.0, -1.0]) + (0.0 x [0.0, 3.0]) + (0.0 x [5.0, 1.0])","act_020":"z_cat = [2.0, -1.0]","note_012":"        z_on = (0.8 x [2.0, -1.0]) + (0.2 x [0.0, 3.0]) + (0.0 x [5.0, 1.0])\n        z_on = [1.6, -0.8] + [0.0, 0.6]","act_021":"z_on = [1.6, -0.2]","note_013":"        z_desk = (0.19 x [2.0, -1.0]) + (0.8 x [0.0, 3.0]) + (0.01 x [5.0, 1.0])\n        z_desk = [0.38, -0.19] + [0.0, 2.4] + [0.05, 0.01]","act_022":"z_desk = [0.43, 2.22]","note_014":"      Context Matrix (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (Context vector for \"cat\")\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (Context vector for \"on\")\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (Context vector for \"desk\")\n      ]","act_023":"Attention for head 2","act_025":"Linear Projection (W_O)","note_015":"    Linear Projection\n    Blends all the parallel attention heads together\n    * A learned projection layer made of trainable parameters (weights)\n    * It changes the internal numbers and values inside the vectors to\n    blend the context of different heads together.\n    * Matrix Multiplication (×)\n    1. Before W_O (The Split Insights): Each of the N heads (2 in the toy, 32 in Llama 3 8B) looks at\n      the sentence from a different logical angle.\n      * Head 1 outputs a small vector representing grammatical structure.\n      * Head 2 outputs a small vector representing animal traits.\n\n    2. The Concatenation Step: The model glues these N separate vectors together\n      side-by-side to create one ultra-wide vector. At this exact moment,\n      the values are still just raw, isolated pieces of information.\n      They haven't been combined yet.\n\n    3. The W_O Multiplication (×): This wide vector is multiplied by the W_O matrix.\n\n    For \"on\" (the walkthrough above worked out head 1; head 2 and W_O are assumed values):\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    Head 1 gives 0.84 + head 2 gives 0.9: one number already mixes both heads.\n    All 4 columns: attention output for \"on\" = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","legend_001":"Color","legend_002":"Meaning","legend_003":"Input: tokens, embedding","legend_004":"RMSNorm (pre-norm)","legend_005":"Attention: Q/K/V, RoPE, scores, mask, softmax, mix, W_O","legend_006":"Residual connection (adds the saved stream back)","legend_007":"Feed-forward network (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head, sampling","legend_009":"A fork = steps that run in parallel.","title_002":"Decoder-only Transformer (Llama-style): Multi-Head Attention in One Layer","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  (0°: unchanged)","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  (0°: unchanged)","note_038":"desk, position 2 (180°):\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","note_036":"[1, -1] x R_position 1\n-> [1, 1]  (90°)","note_037":"[2, 1] x R_position 1\n-> [-1, 2]  (90°)","note_039":"q_cat = [1, 2]\nq_cat x k_cat = (1x2) + (2x1) = 4.0\nq_cat x k_on = (1x-1) + (2x2) = 3.0\nq_cat x k_desk = (1x1) + (2x-1) = -1.0","note_040":"q_on = [1, 1]\nq_on x k_cat = (1x2) + (1x1) = 3.0\nq_on x k_on = (1x-1) + (1x2) = 1.0\nq_on x k_desk = (1x1) + (1x-1) = 0.0","note_041":"q_desk = [0, 2]\nq_desk x k_cat = (0x2) + (2x1) = 2.0\nq_desk x k_on = (0x-1) + (2x2) = 4.0\nq_desk x k_desk = (0x1) + (2x-1) = -2.0"},"zh-tw":{"source_001":"原始碼： https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","part_001":"多頭注意力 (Multi-Head Attention)","part_002":"Q K V 投影與 RoPE","part_003":"語意生成","part_004":"幾何旋轉","part_005":"點積","act_004":"原始 K 矩陣 = X x W_K","act_005":"原始 Q 矩陣 = X x W_Q","act_007":"最終 Q_cat = 原始 Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"最終 K_cat = 原始 K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"最終 Q_on = 原始 Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"最終 K_on = 原始 K_on x R_position 1","act_012":"原始分數 cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"原始分數 on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"原始分數 desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_003":"          線性投影（矩陣乘法）：X x W_Q、X x W_K、X x W_V（下面的範例數值為假設）。\n          Q (Query，查詢) = token 正在找什麼。K (Key，鍵) = 它提供的標籤。\n          V (Value，值) = 被選中時，它要傳出去的內容。\n          Q 和 K 決定「要聽誰的」；V 是「實際拿走什麼」。\n          範例設定（下面用到的名詞）：\n          |= 名詞 |= 意思 |= 範例（顯示 head 1） |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | 一個 token 向量的長度 | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | 平行的注意力 head 數（各有自己的 W_Q、W_K、W_V；它們的 Z 會串接回 d_model） | 2（算出 head 1；head 2 只畫出來、不計算） | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | 每個 head 中一個 Q、K 或 V 列的長度 | 4 / 2 = 2（V 列也一樣：d_v = d_k） | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","note_004":"          目前原始的 Q 和 K 矩陣只帶有語意資訊，還完全沒有順序的概念。\n          正是這一刻，RoPE（旋轉位置編碼，Rotary Position Embedding）登場，完成它們的生成。\n          RoPE 只旋轉 Q 和 K（絕不旋轉 V）。\n          這個範例的玩具旋轉（d_k = 2，只有一對維度）：(0, 1) 每個位置轉 90°。\n          90°：[a, b] -> [-b, a]。180°：[a, b] -> [-a, -b]。\n          （真正的 RoPE 會旋轉 head 內的每一對維度，各有自己的頻率。）\n          最終的 K 和 V 會被加入 KV 快取，所以在 Decode 階段，\n          只需要計算新 token 的 Q、K、V。","note_005":"        目的：評分每個 token 的 Key 與目前 token 的 Query 有多相關（「token i 該看 token j 多少？」）。\n        點積 q x k：逐項相乘再全部加總（算式見上方「原始分數」方塊）；\n        很大 = 方向相近（key 符合 query），接近 0 = 不相關。\n        GPU 一次算完所有組合，Q x K^T：[3, 2] x [2, 3] = 3 × 3 分數表（第 i 列第 j 欄），\n        每格 = 2 次乘加（d_k = 2），是原始分數，還不是權重：\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- 原始分數 cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- 原始分數 on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- 原始分數 desk\n        \"cat\" 對自己的分數最高，\"on\" 最對齊 \"cat\"，\n        \"desk\" 最對齊 \"on\"，也對齊 \"cat\"。\n\n        Decode 階段只計算最後一列：新 token 的 query\n        對上所有已快取的 key（1 x seq_len 個分數）。","act_015":"縮放（除以 sqrt d_k）","note_006":"      為了避免數字爆炸、讓 Softmax 失去判斷力，整個表都要除以 sqrt d_k。\n      原因：每個分數是 d_k 個乘積的總和，d_k 越大分數越大；除以 sqrt d_k 讓尺度保持穩定。\n      這裡 d_k = 2（一個 Q 或 K 列的長度，見線性投影註解的表格），所以 sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41。\n      GPU 把矩陣裡的每一格都除以 1.41。\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"因果遮罩（過濾規則）","note_007":"      因果遮罩就是在這個子步驟出手。\n      系統比較 Query（列）的位置 ID\n      與 Key（欄）的位置 ID。\n      規則：如果 Key 的位置 > Query 的位置，\n      它就是未來的 token，把分數換成負無限大 (-∞)。\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"Softmax 放大（產生百分比）","note_008":"      當這個遮罩後的表送進 Softmax，\n      每一列都處理得很漂亮：第 0 列 (\"cat\")：因為 e^-∞ = 0，\n      未來的位置權重絕對是 0%，\"cat\" 只能 100% 看自己。\n      第 1 列 (\"on\")：\"desk\" 的未來位置是 0%。剩下的分數 (2.12 和 0.71) 互相競爭，\n      結果約為 80% cat 和 20% on (e^2.12 = 8.33，e^0.71 = 2.03，8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80)。\n      第 2 列 (\"desk\")：沒有任何值被擋掉。\n      縮放後的分數 (1.41, 2.83, -1.41) 公開競爭，結果約為\n      19% cat、80% on、1% desk (e^1.41 = 4.10，e^2.83 = 16.95，e^-1.41 = 0.24，除以它們的總和 21.29)。","act_018":"注意力圖矩陣","act_019":"Value 矩陣乘法（混合）","note_010":"      在這一步，模型把注意力圖矩陣乘上 Value 矩陣 (V)。\n      這裡是 token 真正交換資訊的地方：每個 token 的輸出 Z，是它所關注的 token 的 Value 向量的加權總和（例如 \"on\" = 80% 的 cat 的 V + 20% 自己的 V）。\n\n      Context 矩陣 (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      為了用數學看清楚，先算 head 1，並假設每個詞的 Value 向量有 d_head = 2 個數字，和 Q、K 一樣長（真實模型如 Llama 3，d_head 通常是每個 head 128 個數字）。\n      我們幫 Value 向量指定一些像樣的語意數字：\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      GPU 把 Attention Map 每一列的權重乘上 Value 的各欄。\n      這是標準的加權總和，每一列同時平行計算：","note_014":"      Context 矩陣 (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (\"cat\" 的 context 向量)\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (\"on\" 的 context 向量)\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (\"desk\" 的 context 向量)\n      ]","act_023":"第 2 個 head 的注意力","note_015":"    線性投影\n    把所有平行的注意力 head 融合在一起\n    * 一個由可訓練參數（權重）組成、學習而來的投影層\n    * 它會改變向量內部的數字，\n    把不同 head 的 context 融合在一起。\n    * 矩陣乘法 (×)\n    1. W_O 之前（分開的洞察）：N 個 head（範例是 2 個，Llama 3 8B 是 32 個）各自從\n      不同的邏輯角度看這個句子。\n      * Head 1 輸出一個代表文法結構的小向量。\n      * Head 2 輸出一個代表動物特徵的小向量。\n\n    2. 串接步驟：模型把這 N 個獨立的向量並排接在一起，\n      形成一個超寬的向量。此刻這些值\n      還只是原始、各自獨立的資訊，尚未被融合。\n\n    3. W_O 乘法 (×)：這個寬向量乘上 W_O 矩陣。\n\n    \"on\" 的範例（上面的逐步計算算的是 head 1；head 2 與 W_O 為假設值）：\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    Head 1 貢獻 0.84 + head 2 貢獻 0.9：一個數字就已混合兩個 head。\n    4 欄全部算完：\"on\" 的注意力輸出 = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","legend_001":"顏色","legend_002":"意義","legend_003":"輸入：tokens、embedding","legend_004":"RMSNorm（pre-norm）","legend_005":"注意力：Q/K/V、RoPE、分數、遮罩、softmax、混合、W_O","legend_006":"殘差連接（把保留的殘差流加回來）","legend_007":"前饋網路 (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head、抽樣","legend_009":"fork = 平行執行的步驟。","title_002":"Decoder-only Transformer（Llama 風格）：單層的 Multi-Head Attention","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  （0°：不變）","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  （0°：不變）","note_038":"desk，位置 2（180°）：\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","act_025":"線性投影 (W_O)"},"ja":{"source_001":"ソース: https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","part_001":"マルチヘッドアテンション (Multi-Head Attention)","part_002":"Q K V の射影と RoPE","part_003":"意味の生成","part_004":"幾何学的な回転","part_005":"内積","act_004":"生の K 行列 = X x W_K","act_005":"生の Q 行列 = X x W_Q","act_007":"最終 Q_cat = 生の Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"最終 K_cat = 生の K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"最終 Q_on = 生の Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"最終 K_on = 生の K_on x R_position 1","act_012":"生のスコア cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"生のスコア on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"生のスコア desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_003":"          線形射影 (行列の掛け算): X x W_Q, X x W_K, X x W_V (下の数値は仮定した例)。\n          Q (Query) = トークンが探しているもの。K (Key) = 差し出すラベル。\n          V (Value) = 選ばれたときに渡す中身。\n          Q と K は「誰の話を聞くか」、V は「何を受け取るか」を決めます。\n          例の設定 (以下で使う用語):\n          |= 用語 |= 意味 |= 例 (head 1 を表示) |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | 1 トークンのベクトルの長さ | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | 並列のアテンション head の数 (各 head が独自の W_Q, W_K, W_V を持つ。Z は連結して d_model に戻る) | 2 (head 1 を計算; head 2 は描くだけで計算しない) | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | head ごとの Q, K, V の 1 行の長さ | 4 / 2 = 2 (V の行も同じ: d_v = d_k) | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","note_004":"          今のところ、生の Q と K 行列には意味の情報しかなく、\n          並び順の概念はまだありません。まさにこの瞬間に RoPE\n          (回転位置埋め込み, Rotary Position Embedding) が登場して、生成を仕上げます。\n          RoPE が回転させるのは Q と K だけです (V は決して回転させません)。\n          この例の簡易な回転 (d_k = 2 なので次元ペアは 1 つ): (0, 1) が位置ごとに 90° 回ります。\n          90°: [a, b] -> [-b, a]。180°: [a, b] -> [-a, -b]。\n          (実際の RoPE は head 内のすべての次元ペアを、それぞれの周波数で回転させます。)\n          最終的な K と V は KV キャッシュに追加されるので、Decode のときは\n          新しいトークンの Q, K, V だけを計算します。","note_005":"        目的: 各トークンの Key が今のトークンの Query にどれだけ関係あるかを採点 (「トークン i は j をどれだけ見る?」)。\n        内積 q x k: 要素ごとに掛けて全部を足します (計算は上の「生のスコア」ボックス)。\n        大きい = 向きが近い (key が query に合う)、0 に近い = 無関係。\n        GPU は全ペアを一度に採点します、Q x K^T: [3, 2] x [2, 3] = 3 × 3 の表 (i 行 j 列)、\n        各セル = 2 回の積和 (d_k = 2)。まだ重みではなく生のスコアです:\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- 生のスコア cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- 生のスコア on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- 生のスコア desk\n        \"cat\" は自分自身のスコアが最も高く、\"on\" は \"cat\" に最も対応し、\n        \"desk\" は \"on\" に最も対応し、\"cat\" にも対応しています。\n\n        Decode のときは最後の行だけを計算します: 新しいトークンの query を\n        キャッシュ済みのすべての key と掛けます (1 x seq_len 個のスコア)。","act_015":"スケーリング (sqrt d_k で割る)","note_006":"      数字が大きくなりすぎて Softmax 層が見分けられなくなるのを防ぐため、表全体を sqrt d_k で割ります。\n      理由: 各スコアは d_k 個の積の合計なので d_k とともに大きくなります。sqrt d_k で割ると大きさが安定します。\n      ここでは d_k = 2 (Q または K の 1 行の長さ。線形射影のノートの表を参照) なので、sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41 です。\n      GPU は行列のすべてのセルを 1.41 で割ります。\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"因果マスク (フィルタのルール)","note_007":"      まさにこの小さなステップで因果マスクが働きます。\n      システムは Query (行) の位置 ID を\n      Key (列) の位置 ID と比べます。\n      ルール: Key の位置 > Query の位置なら、\n      それは未来のトークンです。スコアを負の無限大 (-∞) に置き換えます。\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"Softmax による強調 (百分率の生成)","note_008":"      このマスク後の表を Softmax に入れると、\n      各行がきれいに処理されます: 行 0 (\"cat\"): e^-∞ = 0 なので、\n      未来のスロットの重みはきっかり 0%。\"cat\" は 100% 自分だけを見ます。\n      行 1 (\"on\"): \"desk\" の未来スロットは 0%。残りのスコア (2.12 と 0.71) が競い合い、\n      結果は cat 約 80%、on 約 20% (e^2.12 = 8.33、e^0.71 = 2.03、8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80)。\n      行 2 (\"desk\"): 隠された値はありません。\n      スケーリング後のスコア (1.41, 2.83, -1.41) が公平に競い合い、結果は\n      cat 約 19%、on 約 80%、desk 約 1% (e^1.41 = 4.10、e^2.83 = 16.95、e^-1.41 = 0.24 をその合計 21.29 で割る)。","act_018":"アテンションマップ行列","act_019":"Value 行列の掛け算 (混ぜ合わせ)","note_010":"      このステップでは、アテンションマップ行列に Value 行列 (V) を掛けます。\n      ここがトークン同士が実際に情報をやり取りする場所です: 各トークンの出力 Z は、注目先のトークンの Value ベクトルの重み付き和です (例: \"on\" = cat の V の 80% + 自分の V の 20%)。\n\n      コンテキスト行列 (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      数式で確かめるために、head 1 を計算し、各単語の Value ベクトルは d_head = 2 個の数字、Q や K と同じ長さとします (Llama 3 のような実際のモデルでは、d_head は通常 1 ヘッドあたり 128 個の数字です)。\n      Value ベクトルにそれらしい意味の数字を割り当てます:\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      GPU はアテンションマップの各行の重みを、Value の各列に掛けます。\n      これは標準的な重み付き和で、各行を同時に並列で計算します:","note_014":"      コンテキスト行列 (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (\"cat\" のコンテキストベクトル)\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (\"on\" のコンテキストベクトル)\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (\"desk\" のコンテキストベクトル)\n      ]","act_023":"ヘッド 2 のアテンション","note_015":"    線形射影\n    並列に動くすべてのアテンションヘッドを混ぜ合わせます\n    * 学習可能なパラメータ (重み) でできた、学習される射影層\n    * ベクトルの中の数字を変えて、\n    異なるヘッドのコンテキストを混ぜ合わせます。\n    * 行列の掛け算 (×)\n    1. W_O の前 (バラバラの洞察): N 個のヘッド (例は 2 個、Llama 3 8B は 32 個)が、それぞれ\n      違う論理的な角度から文を見ています。\n      * ヘッド 1 は文法構造を表す小さなベクトルを出力します。\n      * ヘッド 2 は動物の特徴を表す小さなベクトルを出力します。\n\n    2. 連結ステップ: モデルはこの N 個のバラバラのベクトルを横に並べて、\n      とても幅の広い1本のベクトルにします。この時点では、\n      値はまだ生のままの独立した情報で、混ぜ合わされていません。\n\n    3. W_O の掛け算 (×): この幅広のベクトルに W_O 行列を掛けます。\n\n    \"on\" の例 (上の手順で計算したのはヘッド 1。ヘッド 2 と W_O は仮の値):\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    ヘッド 1 が 0.84 + ヘッド 2 が 0.9: 1 個の数字で両ヘッドが混ざっています。\n    4 列すべて: \"on\" のアテンション出力 = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","legend_001":"色","legend_002":"意味","legend_003":"入力: トークン、エンベディング","legend_004":"RMSNorm (pre-norm)","legend_005":"アテンション: Q/K/V、RoPE、スコア、マスク、softmax、混合、W_O","legend_006":"残差接続 (取っておいたストリームを足し戻す)","legend_007":"フィードフォワードネットワーク (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head、サンプリング","legend_009":"fork = 並列に実行されるステップ。","title_002":"Decoder-only Transformer (Llama 型): 1 層の Multi-Head Attention","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  (0°: 変化なし)","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  (0°: 変化なし)","note_038":"desk、位置 2 (180°):\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","act_025":"線形射影 (W_O)"},"ko":{"source_001":"소스: https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","part_001":"멀티헤드 어텐션 (Multi-Head Attention)","part_002":"Q K V 투영과 RoPE","part_003":"의미 생성","part_004":"기하학적 회전","part_005":"내적","act_004":"원시 K 행렬 = X x W_K","act_005":"원시 Q 행렬 = X x W_Q","act_007":"최종 Q_cat = 원시 Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"최종 K_cat = 원시 K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"최종 Q_on = 원시 Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"최종 K_on = 원시 K_on x R_position 1","act_012":"원시 점수 cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"원시 점수 on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"원시 점수 desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_003":"          선형 투영 (행렬 곱셈): X x W_Q, X x W_K, X x W_V (아래 예시 값은 가정).\n          Q (Query) = 토큰이 찾는 것. K (Key) = 토큰이 내놓는 라벨.\n          V (Value) = 선택되었을 때 전달하는 내용.\n          Q와 K는 \"누구 말을 들을지\", V는 \"무엇을 가져올지\"를 정합니다.\n          예제 설정 (아래에서 쓰는 용어):\n          |= 용어 |= 뜻 |= 예제 (head 1 표시) |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | 토큰 하나의 벡터 길이 | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | 병렬 어텐션 head 수 (각자 자신의 W_Q, W_K, W_V를 가짐; Z는 이어 붙여 d_model로 돌아감) | 2 (head 1만 계산; head 2는 그리기만 하고 계산하지 않음) | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | head마다 Q, K, V 한 행의 길이 | 4 / 2 = 2 (V 행도 같음: d_v = d_k) | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","note_004":"          지금 원시 Q와 K 행렬에는 의미 정보만 있을 뿐,\n          순서라는 개념이 아직 없습니다. 바로 이 순간 RoPE\n          (회전 위치 임베딩, Rotary Position Embedding)가 등장해 생성을 마무리합니다.\n          RoPE는 Q와 K만 회전시킵니다 (V는 절대 회전시키지 않습니다).\n          이 예제의 단순화한 회전 (d_k = 2이므로 차원 쌍은 하나): (0, 1)이 위치마다 90° 돕니다.\n          90°: [a, b] -> [-b, a]. 180°: [a, b] -> [-a, -b].\n          (실제 RoPE는 head 안의 모든 차원 쌍을 각자의 주파수로 회전시킵니다.)\n          최종 K와 V는 KV 캐시에 추가되므로, Decode 중에는\n          새 토큰의 Q, K, V만 계산합니다.","note_005":"        목적: 각 토큰의 Key가 현재 토큰의 Query와 얼마나 관련 있는지 채점 (\"토큰 i가 j를 얼마나 봐야 하나?\").\n        내적 q x k: 원소별로 곱한 뒤 모두 더합니다 (계산은 위의 \"원시 점수\" 상자).\n        큼 = 방향이 비슷함 (key가 query와 맞음), 0에 가까움 = 무관.\n        GPU는 모든 쌍을 한꺼번에 채점합니다, Q x K^T: [3, 2] x [2, 3] = 3 × 3 표 (i행 j열),\n        각 칸 = 곱셈-덧셈 2번 (d_k = 2). 아직 가중치가 아닌 원시 점수입니다:\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- 원시 점수 cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- 원시 점수 on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- 원시 점수 desk\n        \"cat\"은 자기 자신에 대한 점수가 가장 높고, \"on\"은 \"cat\"과 가장 잘 맞고,\n        \"desk\"는 \"on\"과 가장 잘 맞으며 \"cat\"과도 맞습니다.\n\n        Decode 중에는 마지막 행만 계산합니다: 새 토큰의 query를\n        캐시된 모든 key와 곱합니다 (1 x seq_len 개의 점수).","act_015":"스케일링 (sqrt d_k로 나눔)","note_006":"      숫자가 폭주해서 Softmax 층이 구분하지 못하게 되는 것을 막기 위해, 표 전체를 sqrt d_k로 나눕니다.\n      이유: 각 점수는 d_k개 곱의 합이라 d_k와 함께 커집니다. sqrt d_k로 나누면 크기가 안정됩니다.\n      여기서는 d_k = 2 (Q 또는 K 한 행의 길이. 선형 투영 노트의 표 참조)이므로 sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41입니다.\n      GPU는 행렬의 모든 칸을 1.41로 나눕니다.\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"인과 마스크 (필터 규칙)","note_007":"      바로 이 하위 단계에서 인과 마스크가 작동합니다.\n      시스템은 Query(행)의 위치 ID를\n      Key(열)의 위치 ID와 비교합니다.\n      규칙: Key 위치 > Query 위치이면\n      미래 토큰입니다. 점수를 음의 무한대 (-∞)로 바꿉니다.\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"Softmax 증폭 (백분율 생성)","note_008":"      이 마스크된 표를 Softmax에 넣으면,\n      각 행이 아름답게 처리됩니다: 0행 (\"cat\"): e^-∞ = 0이므로,\n      미래 칸의 가중치는 정확히 0%입니다. \"cat\"은 100% 자기 자신만 봅니다.\n      1행 (\"on\"): \"desk\"의 미래 칸은 0%. 남은 점수 (2.12와 0.71)가 경쟁하여\n      결과는 cat 약 80%, on 약 20% (e^2.12 = 8.33, e^0.71 = 2.03, 8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80).\n      2행 (\"desk\"): 가려진 값이 없습니다.\n      스케일링된 점수 (1.41, 2.83, -1.41)가 공개적으로 경쟁하여 결과는\n      cat 약 19%, on 약 80%, desk 약 1% (e^1.41 = 4.10, e^2.83 = 16.95, e^-1.41 = 0.24를 그 합 21.29로 나눔).","act_018":"어텐션 맵 행렬","act_019":"Value 행렬 곱셈 (섞기)","note_010":"      이 단계에서 모델은 어텐션 맵 행렬에 Value 행렬 (V)을 곱합니다.\n      여기가 토큰들이 실제로 정보를 주고받는 곳입니다: 각 토큰의 출력 Z는 주목하는 토큰들의 Value 벡터의 가중합입니다 (예: \"on\" = cat의 V의 80% + 자기 V의 20%).\n\n      컨텍스트 행렬 (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      수학적으로 확인해 보기 위해, head 1을 계산하고, 각 단어의 Value 벡터가 d_head = 2개의 숫자, 즉 Q, K와 같은 길이라고 가정합니다 (Llama 3 같은 실제 모델에서 d_head는 보통 헤드당 128개의 숫자입니다).\n      Value 벡터에 그럴듯한 의미 숫자를 할당해 봅니다:\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      GPU는 어텐션 맵 각 행의 가중치를 Value의 각 열에 곱합니다.\n      이것은 각 행에 대해 동시에 병렬로 수행되는 표준 가중합입니다:","note_014":"      컨텍스트 행렬 (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (\"cat\"의 컨텍스트 벡터)\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (\"on\"의 컨텍스트 벡터)\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (\"desk\"의 컨텍스트 벡터)\n      ]","act_023":"헤드 2의 어텐션","note_015":"    선형 투영\n    병렬로 동작한 모든 어텐션 헤드를 섞어 줍니다\n    * 학습 가능한 파라미터(가중치)로 이루어진, 학습되는 투영 층\n    * 벡터 안의 숫자를 바꿔서\n    서로 다른 헤드의 컨텍스트를 섞습니다.\n    * 행렬 곱셈 (×)\n    1. W_O 이전 (흩어진 통찰): N개(예제는 2개, Llama 3 8B는 32개)의 헤드가 각각\n      다른 논리적 각도에서 문장을 봅니다.\n      * 헤드 1은 문법 구조를 나타내는 작은 벡터를 출력합니다.\n      * 헤드 2는 동물의 특성을 나타내는 작은 벡터를 출력합니다.\n\n    2. 연결 단계: 모델은 이 N개의 개별 벡터를 나란히 붙여\n      아주 넓은 벡터 하나를 만듭니다. 이 순간에는\n      값이 아직 원시적이고 서로 분리된 정보일 뿐, 섞이지 않았습니다.\n\n    3. W_O 곱셈 (×): 이 넓은 벡터에 W_O 행렬을 곱합니다.\n\n    \"on\"의 예시 (위의 단계별 계산은 헤드 1. 헤드 2와 W_O는 가정한 값):\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    헤드 1이 0.84 + 헤드 2가 0.9: 숫자 하나에 두 헤드가 섞여 있습니다.\n    4개 열 모두: \"on\"의 어텐션 출력 = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","legend_001":"색","legend_002":"의미","legend_003":"입력: 토큰, 임베딩","legend_004":"RMSNorm (pre-norm)","legend_005":"어텐션: Q/K/V, RoPE, 점수, 마스크, softmax, 혼합, W_O","legend_006":"잔차 연결 (보관한 스트림을 다시 더함)","legend_007":"피드포워드 네트워크 (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head, 샘플링","legend_009":"fork = 병렬로 실행되는 단계.","title_002":"Decoder-only Transformer (Llama 스타일): 한 레이어의 Multi-Head Attention","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  (0°: 변화 없음)","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  (0°: 변화 없음)","note_038":"desk, 위치 2 (180°):\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","act_025":"선형 투영 (W_O)"}}
!$en = $all.en
!$loc = $all[$lang]
!function $t($key)
!if %json_key_exists($loc, $key)
!return $loc[$key]
!endif
!return $en[$key]
!endfunction
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #555555
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #555555
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B0B0B0
skinparam NoteFontSize 9
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam PartitionFontSize 13
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam LegendBorderColor #B0B0B0
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor<<inputs>> #D6EAF8
  BackgroundColor<<norm>> #FCF3CF
  BackgroundColor<<attn>> #AED6F1
  BackgroundColor<<resid>> #FAD7A0
  BackgroundColor<<ffn>> #ABEBC6
  BackgroundColor<<head>> #D7BDE2
}
skinparam TitleFontStyle plain
title <b>$t("title_002")</b>\n<size:10><color:#888888>$t("source_001")</color></size>
footer $t("source_001")


start
  !$p_001 = $t("part_001")
  partition "$p_001" #EBF5FB {
  fork
    !$p_002 = $t("part_002")
    partition "$p_002" #EBF5FB {
      !$p_003 = $t("part_003")
      partition "$p_003" #EBF5FB {
        fork
          :$t("act_004"); <<attn>>
        fork again
          :$t("act_005"); <<attn>>
        fork again
          :$t("act_006"); <<attn>>
        end fork
        note
$t("note_003")
